	(descr "AMPAK AP6276P Wi-Fi6E/BT 15x13mm 55-pad stamp LGA (superset footprint for AP6275P/AP6275PR3/AP6276P; pad 48 = BT_ANT on PR3 variants, NC-floating on plain P). Perimeter land pattern: 0.9mm pitch, 0.5x1.3mm pads, ring centrelines at +/-7.2875mm (11-pad sides) and +/-6.2875mm (14-pad sides) = datasheet pad centres pushed 0.1mm outward with 1.3mm land length (toe extension), matching proven production layout. Supersedes earlier revision whose 11-pad sides sat at +/-6.625mm (1.125mm too narrow, ~50% land coverage). Inner pads 51/52 dia 0.6mm at (-5.4,4.5)/(-3.6,4.5); pads 53-55 0.7mm square at (0,-1.47)/(0.37,0.79)/(3.3,1.29) per datasheet. Detailed top-layer RF keepout DXF remains FAE-only and is not encoded here.")
